Third-party attribution
-----------------------

The hybrid-backplate full-page screenshot algorithm in
  packages/chrome-extension/src/capture/screenshot-stitcher.ts
follows the pattern from simov/screenshot-capture
  https://github.com/simov/screenshot-capture
which is also MIT-licensed. The implementation was rewritten from scratch
for DesignJS; only the algorithmic approach (scroll-and-stitch with
scrollbar hiding) is borrowed.

Reference / research checkouts under the repo root
  SingleFile/, Blipshot/, onlook/, penpot/, flux/, chrome-devtools-mcp/,
  screenshot-capture/
are upstream projects retained for study and are not redistributed as part
of any published DesignJS package. See each subdirectory's LICENSE for its
terms.
